      "jp": "でも、古墳と言ったら偉い人のお墓だよ。<CR>あってもおかしくないと思う！",
      "en_original": "Think about it. These tombs are for people who had power, which would imply that they had wealth, too!",
      "en_auxiliary": "Think about it. These tombs are for people who had power, which would imply that they had wealth, too!",
      "en": "But ancient tombs are graves for important people.<CR>I don't think it would be strange if there were!",
      "alignment": {
        "status": "exact_index_msg_id",
        "initial_en_source": "official_en",
        "official_en_index": 2,
        "official_en_mapping": "exact_index_msg_id",
